Datasets used for training (not redistributed here; download from their sources)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Nutrition5k
  Thames et al., "Nutrition5k: Towards Automatic Nutritional Understanding of Generic
  Food", CVPR 2021. https://github.com/google-research-datasets/Nutrition5k
  Licence: CC BY 4.0

DFood-TJ-F-Nutr ("Chinese Food Images for Full-cycle Nutrition Analysis Towards Diabetes
  Management"), Scientific Data 2026. Dataset: https://doi.org/10.57760/sciencedb.28012
  Licence: CC0 1.0 (as stated on the Science Data Bank dataset page)
  Contains photos of hospital patients' meals: no image from it is included in this
  repository, its documentation or its released artifacts.

NutritionVerse-Real
  "NutritionVerse: Empirical Study of Various Dietary Intake Estimation Approaches",
  arXiv:2309.07704. https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/nutritionverse/nutritionverse-real
  Licence: CC BY-NC-SA 4.0  ->  this is why the released weights are non-commercial
  (MODEL_LICENSE.md).

